      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003EGaylede.\u003C/b\u003E Take almond milk \u0026 flour of rice, \u0026 do thereto sugar or hony, \u0026 powder ginger \u0026 galyngale; then take figys, an kerve them a-to, or raysonys y-hole, or hard \u003Ca href=\u0022wastel-bread.html\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003Ewastel\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E y-diced and coloure it with \u003Ca href=\u0022sanders-powder.html\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003Esaunderys\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E, \u0026 seethe it \u0026 dresse them yn.\u003Cbr\u003E"
